<!-- END KLY LIVE STREAMING --></div></div><div class="container-article"><div class="inner-container-article"><ul class="read-page--breadcrumb" data-component="desktop:read-page:breadcrumb" data-cache-key="https_liputan6.com:bump:a4c11842f364dc0b67863187f7537794::188_8_116__Category#116_1454043245" data-cache-ttl="120" data-component-name="desktop:read-page:breadcrumb"><li class="read-page--breadcrumb--item" data-component-name="desktop:read-page:breadcrumb:item"><i class="read-page--breadcrumb--item__icon i-arrow-grey"></i><a class="read-page--breadcrumb--item__title" href="https://www.liputan6.com" data-category="Liputan6"><span>Home</span><meta content="1"></a></li><li class="read-page--breadcrumb--item" data-component-name="desktop:read-page:breadcrumb:item"><i class="read-page--breadcrumb--item__icon i-arrow-grey"></i><a class="read-page--breadcrumb--item__title" href="https://www.liputan6.com/tekno" data-category="Tekno"><span>Tekno</span><meta content="2"></a></li><li class="read-page--breadcrumb--item" data-component-name="desktop:read-page:breadcrumb:item"><i class="read-page--breadcrumb--item__icon i-arrow-grey"></i><a class="read-page--breadcrumb--item__title" href="https://www.liputan6.com/tekno/berita" data-category="Tech News"><span>Tech News</span><meta content="3"></a></li></ul><article class="hentry main" data-article-id="5246376" data-component-name="desktop:read-page"><div class="read-page-upper" data-cache-key="https_liputan6.com:bump:xhp_desktop__read_page__read_page_upper:154f8be4e70167728a8eff6f643f363a:TextTypeArticle#5246376_1680075743:new_style:image_delayed" data-cache-ttl="120" data-component-name="desktop:read-page:read-page-upper"><header class="read-page--header" data-component-name="desktop:read-page:header"><h1 class="read-page--header--title entry-title" itemprop="headline" data-component-name="desktop:read-page:header:title">Internet Indonesia Paling Lemot se-Asia Tenggara, Ketinggalan Jauh dari Myanmar dan Filipina</h1><div class="read-page--header--description" data-component-name="desktop:read-page:header:description"><p>Lalu bagaimana dengan kecepatan internet di Indonesia? Dari laporan Oookla, Indonesia menjadi salah satu negara dengan internet terlemot di Asia Tenggara.</p></div><div class="read-page-box read-page-box-top" data-location="top" data-url-retrieve="https://www.liputan6.com/widgets-nocache/article/5246376/comments" data-component="desktop:share" data-component-name="desktop:share"><div class="read-page-box__left"><div class="read-page-box__author"><a href="https://www.liputan6.com/author/Yuslianson" class="read-page-box__author__link" title="Yuslianson" itemprop="url" rel="author"><picture class="read-page-box__author__avatar"><img src="https://cdn1-production-images-kly.akamaized.net/4m0IQY9WjD3dFy_9G-wj8CwFSXk=/26x26/smart/filters:quality(90):strip_icc():format(jpeg)/kly-media-production/avatars/419279/original/055825100_1744875499-Yus_01.jpg" width="26" height="26" alt="Yuslianson" class="read-page-box__author__avatar-img" data-width="26" data-height="26" data-template-var="image"></picture></a><div class="read-page-box__author__datetime"><div class="read-page-box__author__datetime__wrapper"><span>Oleh</span><a href="https://www.liputan6.com/author/Yuslianson" class="read-page-box__author__name">Yuslianson</a></div><span class="read-page-box__author__trigger"><span class="read-page-box__author__updated">Diperbarui 29 Mar 2023, 14:42 WIB</span><svg class="read-page-box__author__arrow" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
